                                                          /______|LPy

                   Presents : Star Trek Cookie Door V 1.2

      A small door for Ami-Express 2.xx and 3.xx that shows a tagline
   with a funny saying about Star Trek and Star Trek The Next Generation
         If you like it, please include it into you logon sequence

   To install it just put all the files in the archive in Doors:STCookie/
                   (Cookie.Rexx , Biscuit , Cookie.Doc)
       The dirs are already made in the archive but just in case =-)

                            Ami-Express V 2.xx
                         ------------------------

     Add to your BBS.CMD : "*COOKIE   RM010DOORS:STCookie/Cookie.Rexx"
                          (Ofcourse without the "")

                            Ami-Express V 3.xx
                         ------------------------
              Drag the icon (Cookie.Info) to your BBS.CMD dir

                             Show It At Logon
                         ------------------------

                        Add to your NodeX/bull.txt
                                --- CUT ---
                                ~CC_COOKIE
                                --- CUT ---

                               ** NOTICE **

  STCookie V 1.2 is PostCardWare.. If you use it, you MUST send a postcard
      of the area/country/city you are living in to the adress below...
                            Smets P.
                            Weldadigheidsstraat 45
                            B-3000 Leuven
                            Belgium

